# Alembic migration versions directory
# =====================================
# Migration files will be generated here by:
#   alembic revision --autogenerate -m "description"
#
# Each generated file will be named:
#   YYYYMMDD_HHMM_<revision_id>_<slug>.py
#
# Example:
#   20240115_0930_a3f8e2c1d4b5_add_companies_table.py
